+## Picking up an issue
+
+Use `typeanvil-issue-loop` as the single pickup procedure. It owns project
+resolution, ownership checks, immediate In Progress state, the explicit release
+branch point, Docker setup, targeted reproduction, and model routing. Repository
+`docs/conventions/issue-evidence.md` and
+`docs/operations/issue-evidence-review.md` define the evidence contract.
+
+Historical examples below describe earlier engine states. Check the current
+spec and source before using them. A main-branch snapshot or an old host command
+cannot establish the current release baseline.
 
